/-!
# Deligne's criterion for logarithmic poles

Let `B` be a smooth algebra over a field `k`, let `t₁, …, t_r ∈ B` be such that at every prime
`𝔭` the differentials of the `tⱼ ∈ 𝔭` are linearly independent in `κ(𝔭) ⊗ Ω_{B/k}` (the divisor
`∑ⱼ V(tⱼ)` has simple normal crossings), and let `L = B[1/f]`, `f = ∏ⱼ tⱼ`. **A form `ω` on `L`
has logarithmic poles along the `tⱼ` if and only if `f ω` and `f dω` are regular**
([Deligne, Hodge II, 3.1]).

One direction is immediate: `tⱼ · dlog tⱼ = dtⱼ`, so `f` clears the poles of a logarithmic form,
and logarithmic forms are stable under `d`. For the other, the question is local on `Spec B`.
Near a prime the `tⱼ ∈ 𝔭` are among étale coordinates `x₁, …, xₙ`, the other `tⱼ` are units, and
flatness over `k[x₁, …, xₙ]` makes the `xⱼ` nonzerodivisors pairwise prime to each other. Put
`θ = f ω`, a regular form. Since `f dω = dθ - df ∧ ω` and `df = h dxⱼ + xⱼ dh` with `f = xⱼ h`,
the form `h dxⱼ ∧ θ` is divisible by `xⱼ`, hence so is `dxⱼ ∧ θ`, and contracting with the dual
vector field `∂/∂xⱼ` shows that `πⱼ θ = θ - dxⱼ ∧ ι_{∂/∂xⱼ} θ` is divisible by `xⱼ`. An induction
on the set of poles, splitting `θ = πⱼ θ + xⱼ dlog xⱼ ∧ ι_{∂/∂xⱼ} θ`, then writes `θ` as `∏ⱼ xⱼ`
times a logarithmic form. Logarithmic forms on the localizations `B_g` come from `B` up to a power
of `g`, and `⋀^q Ω_{L_g}` is the localization of `⋀^q Ω_L`, so some power of `g` carries `ω` into
the logarithmic forms over `B`; the elements doing so form an ideal contained in no maximal ideal.

On a scheme the criterion reads: for a chart `W` of a simple normal crossing family of ideal
sheaves `J j` with equations `tⱼ` and `W ∩ U = D(∏ⱼ tⱼ)`, a relative `q`-form `ω` on `W ∩ U` is a
logarithmic form exactly when `(∏ⱼ cⱼ) ω` and `(∏ⱼ cⱼ) dω` extend over every affine `W' ⊆ W` for
all local sections `cⱼ` of `J j`; since `J j` is generated by `tⱼ`, the condition for `W' = W`,
`cⱼ = tⱼ` implies all the others.

## Main definitions

* `MMP.DeRham.coordProj`: the projection `θ ↦ θ - dxᵢ ∧ ι_{∂/∂xᵢ} θ` of the exterior algebra
  attached to a basis vector.

## Main results

* `MMP.DeRham.exists_mapExteriorPower_eq_prod_smul_of_mem_logForms`: `f ω` and `f dω` are regular
  for a logarithmic form `ω`.
* `MMP.DeRham.coe_mem_logForms_of_smul_mem`: the criterion in coordinates, for a basis `dxᵢ` of
  `Ω_L` with coordinates in `B` on `d B` and poles prime to each other.
* `MMP.DeRham.coe_mem_logForms_of_etale`: the criterion on an étale chart over `k[x₁, …, xₙ]`.
* `MMP.DeRham.exists_pow_smul_eq_mapExteriorPower`: logarithmic forms on a localization `B_g`
  come from `B` up to a power of `g`.
* `MMP.DeRham.coe_mem_logForms_iff`: **Deligne's criterion** for a smooth `k`-algebra with a
  simple normal crossing family.
* `MMP.DeRham.isLocalization_away_of_eq_basicOpen`: the sections over `W ∩ U = D(b)` are `B[1/b]`.
* `MMP.DeRham.forall_exists_extension_iff_mem_logForms`: the criterion on an affine chart of a
  smooth `k`-scheme, in terms of extensions of sections of `Ω^q` and `Ω^{q+1}`.

## Implementation notes

Forms without poles are the logarithmic forms for an empty family of poles; on a chart with a
basis `dxᵢ` of `Ω_L` whose coordinates on `d B` lie in `B` they are the forms with coefficients in
`B`, which is how divisibility by the `xⱼ` is read. The contraction is
`CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft` on the exterior algebra, so all degrees are handled at once.
The sections over `W ∩ U` are made a localization of `Γ(V, W)` through the restriction map;
`W ∩ U` is an affine open by `MMP.DeRham.isAffineOpen_of_eq_basicOpen`.

## References

* [P. Deligne, *Théorie de Hodge II*, Publ. Math. IHÉS 40 (1971)][Deligne1971], 3.1.
* [H. Esnault, E. Viehweg, *Lectures on vanishing theorems*][EsnaultViehweg1992], §2.
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section

open KaehlerDifferential TensorProduct

universe u

namespace MMP.DeRham

/-! ### Generalities on logarithmic forms -/

section Generic

variable {A B L : Type u} [CommRing A] [CommRing B] [CommRing L] [Algebra A L] [Algebra B L]

/-- The logarithmic forms grow with the family of poles. -/
theorem logForms_mono {ι ι' : Type*} {u : ι → B} {u' : ι' → B} (h : ∀ j, ∃ j', u' j' = u j)
    (i : ℕ) : logForms A L u i ≤ logForms A L u' i := by
  refine Submodule.span_mono ?_
  rintro _ ⟨v, hv, rfl⟩
  refine ⟨v, fun m ↦ ?_, rfl⟩
  rcases hv m with ⟨b, hb⟩ | ⟨j, hj⟩
  · exact Or.inl ⟨b, hb⟩
  · obtain ⟨j', hj'⟩ := h j
    exact Or.inr ⟨j', by dsimp only at hj ⊢; rw [hj']; exact hj⟩

/-- The logarithmic forms for two empty families of poles agree: both are the forms without
poles. -/
theorem logForms_isEmpty_eq {ι ι' : Type*} [IsEmpty ι] [IsEmpty ι'] (v : ι → B) (v' : ι' → B)
    (m : ℕ) : logForms A L v m = logForms A L v' m :=
  le_antisymm (logForms_mono (fun j ↦ isEmptyElim j) m) (logForms_mono (fun j ↦ isEmptyElim j) m)

/-- Left multiplication by a `B`-combination of logarithmic generators raises the degree of a
logarithmic form by one. -/
theorem ι_mul_mem_logForms {ι : Type*} {u : ι → B} {w : Ω[L⁄A]}
    (hw : w ∈ Submodule.span B (logGenerators A L u)) {m : ℕ}
    {z : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])} (hz : z ∈ logForms A L u m) :
    ExteriorAlgebra.ι L w * z ∈ logForms A L u (m + 1) := by
  induction hw using Submodule.span_induction with
  | mem w hw =>
    induction hz using Submodule.span_induction with
    | mem z hz =>
      obtain ⟨v, hv, rfl⟩ := hz
      refine Submodule.subset_span ⟨Fin.cons w v, Fin.cases hw hv, ?_⟩
      rw [ExteriorAlgebra.ιMulti_succ_apply]
      simp [Matrix.vecTail, Function.comp_def]
    | zero => rw [mul_zero]; exact zero_mem _
    | add y z _ _ hy hz => rw [mul_add]; exact add_mem hy hz
    | smul c y _ hy => rw [mul_smul_comm]; exact Submodule.smul_mem _ c hy
  | zero => rw [map_zero, zero_mul]; exact zero_mem _
  | add w w' _ _ h h' => rw [map_add, add_mul]; exact add_mem h h'
  | smul c w _ h =>
    rw [← algebraMap_smul L c w, map_smul, smul_mul_assoc, algebraMap_smul]
    exact Submodule.smul_mem _ c h

/-- The unit `1` of the exterior algebra is a logarithmic form of degree `0`. -/
theorem one_mem_logForms_zero {ι : Type*} (u : ι → B) :
    (1 : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) ∈ logForms A L u 0 :=
  Submodule.subset_span ⟨Fin.elim0, fun m ↦ m.elim0, ExteriorAlgebra.ιMulti_zero_apply _⟩

/-- **Contraction against a vector field taking values in `B` on the generators lowers the degree
of a logarithmic form by one**, read in the exterior algebra. -/
theorem contractLeft_mem_logForms {ι : Type*} {u : ι → B} (d : Module.Dual L (Ω[L⁄A]))
    (hd : ∀ w ∈ logGenerators A L u, d w ∈ Set.range (algebraMap B L)) (m : ℕ)
    {z : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])} (hz : z ∈ logForms A L u (m + 1)) :
    CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft d z ∈ logForms A L u m := by
  have key : ∀ (m : ℕ) (v : Fin (m + 1) → Ω[L⁄A]), (∀ i, v i ∈ logGenerators A L u) →
      CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft d (ExteriorAlgebra.ιMulti L (m + 1) v) ∈ logForms A L u m := by
    intro m
    induction m with
    | zero =>
      intro v hv
      rw [ExteriorAlgebra.ιMulti_succ_apply, ExteriorAlgebra.ιMulti_zero_apply,
        CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft_ι_mul, CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft_one, mul_zero, sub_zero]
      obtain ⟨c, hc⟩ := hd _ (hv 0)
      rw [← hc, algebraMap_smul]
      exact Submodule.smul_mem _ c (one_mem_logForms_zero u)
    | succ m ih =>
      intro v hv
      rw [ExteriorAlgebra.ιMulti_succ_apply, CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft_ι_mul]
      obtain ⟨c, hc⟩ := hd _ (hv 0)
      refine sub_mem ?_ (ι_mul_mem_logForms (Submodule.subset_span (hv 0))
        (ih _ fun i ↦ hv _))
      rw [← hc, algebraMap_smul]
      exact Submodule.smul_mem _ c (ιMulti_mem_logForms _ fun i ↦ hv _)
  induction hz using Submodule.span_induction with
  | mem z hz =>
    obtain ⟨v, hv, rfl⟩ := hz
    exact key m v hv
  | zero => rw [map_zero]; exact zero_mem _
  | add y z _ _ hy hz => rw [map_add]; exact add_mem hy hz
  | smul c y _ hy =>
    rw [← algebraMap_smul L c y, map_smul, algebraMap_smul]
    exact Submodule.smul_mem _ c hy

/-- Contraction kills the logarithmic forms of degree `0`. -/
theorem contractLeft_eq_zero_of_mem_logForms_zero {ι : Type*} {u : ι → B}
    (d : Module.Dual L (Ω[L⁄A])) {z : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])} (hz : z ∈ logForms A L u 0) :
    CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft d z = 0 := by
  induction hz using Submodule.span_induction with
  | mem z hz =>
    obtain ⟨v, -, rfl⟩ := hz
    rw [ExteriorAlgebra.ιMulti_zero_apply, CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft_one]
  | zero => rw [map_zero]
  | add y z _ _ hy hz => rw [map_add, hy, hz, add_zero]
  | smul c y _ hy => rw [← algebraMap_smul L c y, map_smul, hy, smul_zero]

end Generic

/-! ### Regular forms in coordinates

Let `x₁, …, xₙ ∈ B` be such that the `dxᵢ` form a basis of `Ω[L⁄A]` whose coordinates on every
`db`, `b ∈ B`, lie in `B`. The forms without poles are the logarithmic forms for an empty family of
poles; their coefficients in the basis `dx_s` lie in `B`, and conversely. -/

section Regular

variable {A B L : Type u} [CommRing A] [CommRing B] [CommRing L] [Algebra A L] [Algebra B L]
  {n : ℕ} {x : Fin n → B} {bL : Module.Basis (Fin n) L (Ω[L⁄A])}

private theorem logBasis_empty (hP : ∀ j ∈ (∅ : Finset (Fin n)), IsUnit (algebraMap B L (x j))) :
    logBasis bL hP = bL :=
  Module.Basis.eq_of_apply_eq fun j ↦ by rw [logBasis_apply]; simp [logScale]

variable (hb : ∀ j, bL j = D A L (algebraMap B L (x j)))
  (hcoord : ∀ (b : B) j, bL.repr (D A L (algebraMap B L b)) j ∈ Set.range (algebraMap B L))

include hb

include hcoord in
/-- The coefficients of a form without poles in the basis `dx_s` lie in `B`. -/
theorem exteriorPower_repr_mem_range_of_mem_logForms {ι : Type*} [IsEmpty ι] {v : ι → B}
    {m : ℕ} (y : ⋀[L]^m (Ω[L⁄A]))
    (hy : (y : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) ∈ logForms A L v m) (s : Set.powersetCard (Fin n) m) :
    ((bL.exteriorPower m).repr y s) ∈ Set.range (algebraMap B L) := by
  have hP : ∀ j ∈ (∅ : Finset (Fin n)), IsUnit (algebraMap B L (x j)) := by simp
  have := logBasis_exteriorPower_repr_mem_range hP hb (u := v) (fun k ↦ isEmptyElim k) hcoord
    y hy s
  rwa [logBasis_empty hP] at this

/-- A form whose coefficients in the basis `dx_s` lie in `B` has no poles. -/
theorem coe_sum_mem_logForms_of_isEmpty {ι : Type*} [IsEmpty ι] (v : ι → B) {m : ℕ}
    (c : Set.powersetCard (Fin n) m → B) :
    ((∑ s, algebraMap B L (c s) • bL.exteriorPower m s : ⋀[L]^m (Ω[L⁄A])) :
      ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) ∈ logForms A L v m := by
  have hP : ∀ j ∈ (∅ : Finset (Fin n)), IsUnit (algebraMap B L (x j)) := by simp
  have := coe_sum_logBasis_mem_logForms hP hb (u := v) (by simp) c
  rwa [logBasis_empty hP] at this

include hcoord in
/-- **Divisibility of forms without poles is read on coefficients**: if `a ω = b ω'` for forms
`ω`, `ω'` without poles, and `b` divides `r` whenever it divides `a r`, then `ω = b ω''` for a
form `ω''` without poles. -/
theorem exists_eq_smul_of_smul_eq_smul (hinj : Function.Injective (algebraMap B L))
    {ι : Type*} [IsEmpty ι] {v : ι → B} {m : ℕ} {a b : B} (hab : ∀ r, b ∣ a * r → b ∣ r)
    {z z' : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])} (hz : z ∈ logForms A L v m)
    (hz' : z' ∈ logForms A L v m) (h : a • z = b • z') :
    ∃ z'' ∈ logForms A L v m, z = b • z'' := by
  obtain ⟨y, rfl⟩ : ∃ y : ⋀[L]^m (Ω[L⁄A]), (y : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) = z :=
    ⟨⟨z, logForms_le v m hz⟩, rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨y', rfl⟩ : ∃ y : ⋀[L]^m (Ω[L⁄A]), (y : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) = z' :=
    ⟨⟨z', logForms_le v m hz'⟩, rfl⟩
  have hyy : a • y = b • y' := by
    refine Subtype.coe_injective ?_
    simp only [Submodule.coe_smul_of_tower]
    exact h
  set 𝔅 := bL.exteriorPower m
  choose β hβ using exteriorPower_repr_mem_range_of_mem_logForms hb hcoord y hz
  choose β' hβ' using exteriorPower_repr_mem_range_of_mem_logForms hb hcoord y' hz'
  have hrepr : ∀ (c : B) (w : ⋀[L]^m (Ω[L⁄A])) s,
      𝔅.repr (c • w) s = algebraMap B L c * 𝔅.repr w s := by
    intro c w s
    rw [← algebraMap_smul L c w, map_smul, Finsupp.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul]
  have hdiv : ∀ s, b ∣ β s := by
    intro s
    have h1 := congrArg (fun w ↦ 𝔅.repr w s) hyy
    simp only [hrepr] at h1
    rw [← hβ s, ← hβ' s, ← map_mul, ← map_mul] at h1
    exact hab _ ⟨_, hinj h1⟩
  choose γ hγ using hdiv
  refine ⟨_, coe_sum_mem_logForms_of_isEmpty hb v γ, ?_⟩
  rw [← Submodule.coe_smul_of_tower]
  congr 1
  conv_lhs => rw [← 𝔅.sum_repr y]
  rw [Finset.smul_sum]
  refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun s _ ↦ ?_
  rw [← hβ, hγ, map_mul, mul_smul, algebraMap_smul]

end Regular

/-! ### The criterion in coordinates

Let `x₁, …, xₙ ∈ B` be as in the previous section, and let the poles `uⱼ` (`j ∈ κ`) be among the
coordinates, `uⱼ = x_{ε j}`, units in `L`, with `uⱼ` prime to `u_{j'}` for `j ≠ j'`. Write
`ιᵢ` for the contraction against the dual basis vector of `dxᵢ`, and `πᵢ = 1 - dxᵢ ∧ ιᵢ` for the
projection killing `dxᵢ`. A form `θ` without poles is divisible by `∏_{j ∈ T} uⱼ` with a quotient
having logarithmic poles along `T` as soon as `π_{ε j} θ` is divisible by `uⱼ` for every `j ∈ T`:
writing `θ = π θ + dx ∧ ι θ`, the first summand is `uⱼ` times a form without poles, the second is
`uⱼ dlog uⱼ ∧ ι θ`, and both pieces again satisfy the hypothesis for `T ∖ {j}`. -/

section Coordinates

variable {A B L : Type u} [CommRing A] [CommRing B] [CommRing L] [Algebra A L] [Algebra B L]
  {n : ℕ} {x : Fin n → B} {bL : Module.Basis (Fin n) L (Ω[L⁄A])}

/-- The projection `πᵢ = 1 - dxᵢ ∧ ιᵢ` of the exterior algebra killing `dxᵢ`. -/
def coordProj (bL : Module.Basis (Fin n) L (Ω[L⁄A])) (i : Fin n)
    (z : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A]) :=
  z - ExteriorAlgebra.ι L (bL i) * CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft (bL.coord i) z

/-- The `i`-th coordinate function of the basis `bL` takes the value `1` on `bL i` and `0` on
the other basis vectors. -/
theorem coord_self (i k : Fin n) : bL.coord i (bL k) = if k = i then 1 else 0 := by
  rw [Module.Basis.coord_apply, Module.Basis.repr_self, Finsupp.single_apply]

/-- Contracting `dxᵢ ∧ z` with `∂/∂xᵢ` gives the projection `πᵢ z`. -/
theorem contractLeft_ι_mul_self (i : Fin n) (z : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) :
    CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft (bL.coord i) (ExteriorAlgebra.ι L (bL i) * z) =
      coordProj bL i z := by
  rw [CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft_ι_mul, coord_self]
  simp only [↓reduceIte, one_smul, coordProj]

/-- For `k ≠ i`, contraction with `∂/∂xᵢ` anticommutes with left multiplication by `dxₖ`. -/
theorem contractLeft_ι_mul_of_ne {i k : Fin n} (h : k ≠ i) (z : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) :
    CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft (bL.coord i) (ExteriorAlgebra.ι L (bL k) * z) =
      -(ExteriorAlgebra.ι L (bL k) * CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft (bL.coord i) z) := by
  rw [CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft_ι_mul, coord_self]
  simp only [h, ↓reduceIte, zero_smul, zero_sub]

/-- For `k ≠ i`, the projection `πₖ` commutes with contraction against `∂/∂xᵢ`. -/
theorem coordProj_contractLeft_comm {i k : Fin n} (h : k ≠ i) (z : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) :
    coordProj bL k (CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft (bL.coord i) z) =
      CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft (bL.coord i) (coordProj bL k z) := by
  rw [coordProj, coordProj, map_sub, contractLeft_ι_mul_of_ne h, CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft_comm
    (bL.coord i) (bL.coord k), mul_neg, sub_neg_eq_add, sub_eq_add_neg]

/-- The projections `πᵢ` and `πₖ` commute for `k ≠ i`. -/
theorem coordProj_comm {i k : Fin n} (h : k ≠ i) (z : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) :
    coordProj bL k (coordProj bL i z) = coordProj bL i (coordProj bL k z) := by
  have hι : ExteriorAlgebra.ι L (bL k) * ExteriorAlgebra.ι L (bL i) =
      -(ExteriorAlgebra.ι L (bL i) * ExteriorAlgebra.ι L (bL k)) :=
    eq_neg_of_add_eq_zero_left (ExteriorAlgebra.ι_add_mul_swap _ _)
  have hc := CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft_comm (Q := 0) (bL.coord k) (bL.coord i) z
  simp only [coordProj, map_sub, contractLeft_ι_mul_of_ne h, contractLeft_ι_mul_of_ne h.symm,
    sub_neg_eq_add]
  rw [mul_add, mul_add, ← mul_assoc, ← mul_assoc, hι, hc, neg_mul, mul_neg, neg_neg]
  abel

/-- The projection `πᵢ` is `B`-linear. -/
theorem coordProj_smul (i : Fin n) (c : B) (z : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) :
    coordProj bL i (c • z) = c • coordProj bL i z := by
  rw [coordProj, coordProj, ← algebraMap_smul L c z, map_smul, mul_smul_comm, ← smul_sub,
    algebraMap_smul]

/-- Contraction against an `L`-linear form on `Ω[L⁄A]` is `B`-linear. -/
theorem contractLeft_smul_of_tower (d : Module.Dual L (Ω[L⁄A])) (c : B)
    (z : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) :
    CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft d (c • z) = c • CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft d z := by
  rw [← algebraMap_smul L c z, map_smul, algebraMap_smul]

variable (hb : ∀ j, bL j = D A L (algebraMap B L (x j)))
  (hcoord : ∀ (b : B) j, bL.repr (D A L (algebraMap B L b)) j ∈ Set.range (algebraMap B L))

include hcoord in
/-- For an empty family of poles, the `i`-th coordinate of a logarithmic generator lies in
`B`. -/
theorem coord_mem_range_of_mem_logGenerators {ι : Type*} [IsEmpty ι] {v : ι → B} (i : Fin n)
    {w : Ω[L⁄A]} (hw : w ∈ logGenerators A L v) :
    bL.coord i w ∈ Set.range (algebraMap B L) := by
  rcases hw with ⟨b, rfl⟩ | ⟨k, -⟩
  · rw [Module.Basis.coord_apply]; exact hcoord b i
  · exact isEmptyElim k

include hb hcoord in
/-- For an empty family of poles, the projection `πᵢ` preserves the forms without poles of each
degree. -/
theorem coordProj_mem_logForms {ι : Type*} [IsEmpty ι] {v : ι → B} (i : Fin n) {m : ℕ}
    {z : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])} (hz : z ∈ logForms A L v m) :
    coordProj bL i z ∈ logForms A L v m := by
  cases m with
  | zero =>
    rw [coordProj, contractLeft_eq_zero_of_mem_logForms_zero _ hz, mul_zero, sub_zero]
    exact hz
  | succ m =>
    refine sub_mem hz (ι_mul_mem_logForms ?_ (contractLeft_mem_logForms _
      (fun w hw ↦ coord_mem_range_of_mem_logGenerators hcoord i hw) m hz))
    rw [hb]
    exact Submodule.subset_span (D_mem_logGenerators v _)

end Coordinates

section Criterion

variable {A B L : Type u} [CommRing A] [CommRing B] [CommRing L] [Algebra A L] [Algebra B L]
  {n : ℕ} {x : Fin n → B} {bL : Module.Basis (Fin n) L (Ω[L⁄A])}
  (hb : ∀ j, bL j = D A L (algebraMap B L (x j)))
  (hcoord : ∀ (b : B) j, bL.repr (D A L (algebraMap B L b)) j ∈ Set.range (algebraMap B L))
  (hinj : Function.Injective (algebraMap B L))
  {κ : Type*} {ε : κ → Fin n} (hε : Function.Injective ε) {u : κ → B}
  (hu : ∀ j, x (ε j) = u j)
  (hcop : ∀ j j', j ≠ j' → ∀ r, u j ∣ u j' * r → u j ∣ r)
  (hunit : ∀ j, IsUnit (algebraMap B L (u j)))

include hb hcoord hinj hε hu hcop hunit in
/-- **Division of a form without poles by the equations of the poles.** If `θ` has no poles and
`π_{ε j} θ` is `uⱼ` times a form without poles for every `j ∈ T`, then `θ` is `∏_{j ∈ T} uⱼ`
times a form with logarithmic poles along the `uⱼ`, `j ∈ T`. -/
theorem exists_eq_prod_smul_of_coordProj (T : Finset κ) :
    ∀ (m : ℕ) (z : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])),
      z ∈ logForms A L (fun j : (∅ : Finset κ) ↦ u j) m →
      (∀ j ∈ T, ∃ z' ∈ logForms A L (fun j : (∅ : Finset κ) ↦ u j) m,
        coordProj bL (ε j) z = u j • z') →
      ∃ y ∈ logForms A L (fun j : T ↦ u j) m, z = (∏ j ∈ T, u j) • y := by
  classical
  have hgen : ∀ j m (z : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])),
      z ∈ logForms A L (fun j : (∅ : Finset κ) ↦ u j) (m + 1) →
        CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft (bL.coord (ε j)) z ∈
          logForms A L (fun j : (∅ : Finset κ) ↦ u j) m :=
    fun _ m _ hz ↦ contractLeft_mem_logForms _
      (fun w hw ↦ coord_mem_range_of_mem_logGenerators hcoord _ hw) m hz
  induction T using Finset.induction_on with
  | empty => exact fun _ z hz _ ↦ ⟨z, hz, by rw [Finset.prod_empty, one_smul]⟩
  | insert i T hi ih =>
    intro m z hz hyp
    obtain ⟨z', hz', hπ⟩ := hyp i (Finset.mem_insert_self i T)
    have hT : ∀ k ∈ T, ∃ z'' ∈ logForms A L (fun j : (∅ : Finset κ) ↦ u j) m,
        coordProj bL (ε k) z' = u k • z'' := by
      intro k hk
      have hki : k ≠ i := fun h ↦ hi (h ▸ hk)
      obtain ⟨zk, hzk, hπk⟩ := hyp k (Finset.mem_insert_of_mem hk)
      refine exists_eq_smul_of_smul_eq_smul hb hcoord hinj (a := u i) (b := u k)
        (hcop k i hki) (coordProj_mem_logForms hb hcoord _ hz')
        (coordProj_mem_logForms hb hcoord (ε i) hzk) ?_
      rw [← coordProj_smul, ← hπ, coordProj_comm (fun h ↦ hki (hε h)), hπk, coordProj_smul]
    obtain ⟨y', hy', rfl⟩ := ih m z' hz' hT
    have hmono : ∀ m, logForms A L (fun j : T ↦ u j) m ≤
        logForms A L (fun j : (insert i T : Finset κ) ↦ u j) m :=
      logForms_mono (fun j ↦ ⟨⟨j, Finset.mem_insert_of_mem j.2⟩, rfl⟩)
    rw [Finset.prod_insert hi]
    cases m with
    | zero =>
      have h0 : coordProj bL (ε i) z = z := by
        rw [coordProj, contractLeft_eq_zero_of_mem_logForms_zero _ hz, mul_zero, sub_zero]
      refine ⟨y', hmono 0 hy', ?_⟩
      rw [← h0, hπ, mul_smul]
    | succ m =>
      have hw := hgen i m z hz
      have hT' : ∀ k ∈ T, ∃ z'' ∈ logForms A L (fun j : (∅ : Finset κ) ↦ u j) m,
          coordProj bL (ε k) (CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft (bL.coord (ε i)) z) = u k • z'' := by
        intro k hk
        have hki : k ≠ i := fun h ↦ hi (h ▸ hk)
        obtain ⟨zk, hzk, hπk⟩ := hyp k (Finset.mem_insert_of_mem hk)
        refine ⟨_, hgen i m zk hzk, ?_⟩
        rw [coordProj_contractLeft_comm (fun h ↦ hki (hε h)), hπk, contractLeft_smul_of_tower]
      obtain ⟨y'', hy'', he⟩ := ih m _ hw hT'
      have hdlmem := dlog_mem_logGenerators (A := A) (L := L)
        (fun j : (insert i T : Finset κ) ↦ u j) ⟨i, Finset.mem_insert_self i T⟩
      obtain ⟨dl, hdl⟩ : ∃ dl : Ω[L⁄A],
          dl = Ring.inverse (algebraMap B L (u i)) • D A L (algebraMap B L (u i)) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
      rw [← hdl] at hdlmem
      have hdx : bL (ε i) = algebraMap B L (u i) • dl := by
        rw [hb, hu, hdl, smul_smul, Ring.mul_inverse_cancel _ (hunit i), one_smul]
      refine ⟨y' + ExteriorAlgebra.ι L dl * y'', add_mem (hmono _ hy')
        (ι_mul_mem_logForms (Submodule.subset_span hdlmem) (hmono m hy'')), ?_⟩
      calc z = coordProj bL (ε i) z + ExteriorAlgebra.ι L (bL (ε i)) *
            CliffordAlgebra.contractLeft (bL.coord (ε i)) z := by rw [coordProj, sub_add_cancel]
        _ = _ := by
          rw [hπ, he, hdx, map_smul, smul_add, mul_smul, mul_smul, smul_mul_assoc, mul_smul_comm,
            algebraMap_smul]

omit hb hcoord hinj hε hu hunit in
include hcop in
/-- For `uⱼ` pairwise prime to each other, if `uᵢ` divides `(∏_{j ∈ S} uⱼ) r` with `i ∉ S`, then
`uᵢ` divides `r`. -/
theorem dvd_of_dvd_prod_mul {i : κ} (S : Finset κ) (hi : i ∉ S) (r : B)
    (h : u i ∣ (∏ j ∈ S, u j) * r) : u i ∣ r := by
  classical
  induction S using Finset.induction_on generalizing r with
  | empty => rwa [Finset.prod_empty, one_mul] at h
  | insert j S hj ih =>
    rw [Finset.prod_insert hj, mul_assoc] at h
    exact ih (fun h' ↦ hi (Finset.mem_insert_of_mem h')) _
      (hcop i j (fun h' ↦ hi (h' ▸ Finset.mem_insert_self _ _)) _ h)

include hb hcoord hinj hε hu hcop hunit in
/-- **Deligne's criterion in coordinates.** Let `f = c ∏ⱼ uⱼ` with `c` a unit of `B`. A `q`-form
`ω` on `L` such that `f ω` and `f dω` have no poles has logarithmic poles along the `uⱼ`. -/
theorem coe_mem_logForms_of_smul_mem [Fintype κ] (c : B) (hc : IsUnit c) {q : ℕ}
    (ω : ⋀[L]^q (Ω[L⁄A]))
    (hA : ((algebraMap B L (c * ∏ j, u j) • ω : ⋀[L]^q (Ω[L⁄A])) :
      ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) ∈ logForms A L (fun j : (∅ : Finset κ) ↦ u j) q)
    (hB : ((algebraMap B L (c * ∏ j, u j) • deRhamDifferential (A := A) q ω :
      ⋀[L]^(q + 1) (Ω[L⁄A])) : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) ∈
        logForms A L (fun j : (∅ : Finset κ) ↦ u j) (q + 1)) :
    (ω : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) ∈ logForms A L u q := by
  classical
  set f := c * ∏ j, u j with hf
  set θ : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A]) := ((algebraMap B L f • ω : ⋀[L]^q (Ω[L⁄A])) :
    ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) with hθ
  have hθ' : θ = f • (ω : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) := by
    rw [hθ, Submodule.coe_smul, algebraMap_smul]
  have hgen : ∀ b : B, D A L (algebraMap B L b) ∈
      Submodule.span B (logGenerators A L (fun j : (∅ : Finset κ) ↦ u j)) :=
    fun b ↦ Submodule.subset_span (D_mem_logGenerators _ b)
  have hd : ((deRhamDifferential (A := A) q (algebraMap B L f • ω) : ⋀[L]^(q + 1) (Ω[L⁄A])) :
      ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) = ExteriorAlgebra.ι L (D A L (algebraMap B L f)) * ω +
        ((algebraMap B L f • deRhamDifferential (A := A) q ω : ⋀[L]^(q + 1) (Ω[L⁄A])) :
          ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) := by
    rw [deRhamDifferential_smul, Submodule.coe_add, exteriorPower.coe_wedgeLeft]
  obtain ⟨z₁, hz₁, he₁⟩ : ∃ z₁ ∈ logForms A L (fun j : (∅ : Finset κ) ↦ u j) (q + 1),
      ExteriorAlgebra.ι L (D A L (algebraMap B L f)) * θ = f • z₁ :=
    ⟨_, sub_mem (coe_deRhamDifferential_mem_logForms _ q _ hA) hB, by
      rw [hd, add_sub_cancel_right, hθ', mul_smul_comm]⟩
  have h2 : ∀ i, ∃ z' ∈ logForms A L (fun j : (∅ : Finset κ) ↦ u j) q,
      coordProj bL (ε i) θ = u i • z' := by
    intro i
    set h := c * ∏ j ∈ Finset.univ.erase i, u j with hh
    have hfh : f = u i * h := by
      rw [hf, hh, mul_left_comm, Finset.mul_prod_erase _ _ (Finset.mem_univ i)]
    have hcop' : ∀ r, u i ∣ h * r → u i ∣ r := by
      intro r hr
      rw [hh, mul_assoc, hc.dvd_mul_left] at hr
      exact dvd_of_dvd_prod_mul hcop _ (Finset.notMem_erase i _) r hr
    clear_value h
    have hDf : D A L (algebraMap B L f) = algebraMap B L (u i) • D A L (algebraMap B L h) +
        algebraMap B L h • bL (ε i) := by
      rw [hfh, map_mul, Derivation.leibniz, hb, hu, add_comm]
    have hdx : bL (ε i) ∈ Submodule.span B (logGenerators A L (fun j : (∅ : Finset κ) ↦ u j)) := by
      rw [hb]; exact hgen _
    obtain ⟨z₂, hz₂, he₂⟩ := exists_eq_smul_of_smul_eq_smul hb hcoord hinj hcop'
      (z := ExteriorAlgebra.ι L (bL (ε i)) * θ)
      (z' := h • z₁ - ExteriorAlgebra.ι L (D A L (algebraMap B L h)) * θ)
      (ι_mul_mem_logForms hdx hA)
      (sub_mem (Submodule.smul_mem _ _ hz₁) (ι_mul_mem_logForms (hgen h) hA)) (by
        have := he₁
        rw [hDf, map_add, add_mul, map_smul, map_smul, smul_mul_assoc, smul_mul_assoc,
          algebraMap_smul, algebraMap_smul, hfh, mul_smul] at this
        rw [smul_sub, ← this, add_sub_cancel_left])
    refine ⟨_, contractLeft_mem_logForms (bL.coord (ε i))
      (fun w hw ↦ coord_mem_range_of_mem_logGenerators hcoord _ hw) q hz₂, ?_⟩
    rw [← contractLeft_ι_mul_self, he₂, contractLeft_smul_of_tower]
  obtain ⟨y, hy, hyθ⟩ := exists_eq_prod_smul_of_coordProj hb hcoord hinj hε hu hcop hunit
    Finset.univ q θ hA (fun j _ ↦ h2 j)
  have hp : IsUnit (algebraMap B L (∏ j, u j)) := by
    rw [map_prod]
    exact Finset.prod_induction _ IsUnit (fun a b ha hb ↦ ha.mul hb) isUnit_one
      (fun j _ ↦ hunit j)
  have key : algebraMap B L (∏ j, u j) • (c • (ω : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A]))) =
      algebraMap B L (∏ j, u j) • y := by
    rw [algebraMap_smul, algebraMap_smul, smul_smul, mul_comm, ← hf, ← hθ', hyθ]
  have hcy : c • (ω : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) = y := hp.smul_left_cancel.mp key
  obtain ⟨c', hc'⟩ := hc
  have hω : (ω : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) = (↑c'⁻¹ : B) • y := by
    rw [← hcy, ← hc', smul_smul, Units.inv_mul, one_smul]
  rw [hω]
  exact logForms_mono (u := fun j : (Finset.univ : Finset κ) ↦ u j) (u' := u)
    (fun j ↦ ⟨j.1, rfl⟩) q (Submodule.smul_mem _ _ hy)

end Criterion

/-! ### Forms without poles are the forms coming from `B` -/

section Regular'

variable {A B L : Type u} [CommRing A] [CommRing B] [CommRing L] [Algebra A B] [Algebra A L]
  [Algebra B L] [IsScalarTower A B L]

/-- The image of an algebraic form on `B` has no poles. -/
theorem coe_mapExteriorPower_base_mem_logForms {ι : Type*} (v : ι → B) {q : ℕ}
    (η : ⋀[B]^q (Ω[B⁄A])) :
    ((mapExteriorPower A B L q η : ⋀[L]^q (Ω[L⁄A])) : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) ∈
      logForms A L v q := by
  have hspan : ∀ w : Ω[B⁄A], map A A B L w ∈ Submodule.span B (logGenerators A L v) := by
    intro w
    have hw : w ∈ Submodule.span B (Set.range (D A B)) := by
      rw [span_range_derivation]; exact Submodule.mem_top
    induction hw using Submodule.span_induction with
    | mem w hw =>
      obtain ⟨b, rfl⟩ := hw
      rw [map_D]
      exact Submodule.subset_span (D_mem_logGenerators v b)
    | zero => rw [map_zero]; exact zero_mem _
    | add w w' _ _ h h' => rw [map_add]; exact add_mem h h'
    | smul c w _ h => rw [map_smul]; exact Submodule.smul_mem _ c h
  have hη : η ∈ Submodule.span B (Set.range (exteriorPower.ιMulti B q)) := by
    rw [exteriorPower.ιMulti_span]; exact Submodule.mem_top
  induction hη using Submodule.span_induction with
  | mem η hη =>
    obtain ⟨w, rfl⟩ := hη
    rw [mapExteriorPower_ιMulti, exteriorPower.ιMulti_apply_coe]
    exact ιMulti_mem_logForms_of_mem_span _ fun i ↦ hspan _
  | zero => rw [map_zero, ZeroMemClass.coe_zero]; exact zero_mem _
  | add η η' _ _ h h' => rw [map_add, Submodule.coe_add]; exact add_mem h h'
  | smul c η _ h =>
    rw [map_smul, Submodule.coe_smul_of_tower]; exact Submodule.smul_mem _ c h

/-- A form without poles is the image of an algebraic form on `B`. -/
theorem exists_mapExteriorPower_eq_of_mem_logForms_isEmpty {ι : Type*} [IsEmpty ι]
    {v : ι → B} {q : ℕ} (y : ⋀[L]^q (Ω[L⁄A]))
    (hy : (y : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) ∈ logForms A L v q) :
    ∃ η : ⋀[B]^q (Ω[B⁄A]), mapExteriorPower A B L q η = y := by
  refine mem_of_mem_logForms (LinearMap.range (mapExteriorPower A B L q)) (fun w hw ↦ ?_) y hy
  have : ∀ m, ∃ b : B, D A L (algebraMap B L b) = w m := by
    intro m
    rcases hw m with ⟨b, hb⟩ | ⟨k, -⟩
    · exact ⟨b, hb⟩
    · exact isEmptyElim k
  choose b hb using this
  refine ⟨exteriorPower.ιMulti B q fun m ↦ D A B (b m), ?_⟩
  rw [mapExteriorPower_ιMulti]
  congr 1
  funext m
  rw [map_D, ← hb]

/-- **Multiplying a logarithmic form by the equations of the poles removes the poles**: if the
`uⱼ` are units in `L`, then `(∏ⱼ uⱼ) ω` has no poles for every logarithmic form `ω`. -/
theorem prod_smul_mem_logForms {ι ι' : Type*} [Fintype ι] {u : ι → B} (v : ι' → B)
    (hunit : ∀ j, IsUnit (algebraMap B L (u j))) {q : ℕ} {z : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])}
    (hz : z ∈ logForms A L u q) : (∏ j, u j) • z ∈ logForms A L v q := by
  classical
  have key : ∀ (m : ℕ) (w : Fin m → Ω[L⁄A]), (∀ k, w k ∈ logGenerators A L u) →
      ∃ S : Finset ι, (∀ j ∈ S, ∃ k, w k =
        Ring.inverse (algebraMap B L (u j)) • D A L (algebraMap B L (u j))) ∧
        (∏ j ∈ S, u j) • ExteriorAlgebra.ιMulti L m w ∈ logForms A L v m := by
    intro m
    induction m with
    | zero =>
      intro w _
      refine ⟨∅, by simp, ?_⟩
      rw [Finset.prod_empty, one_smul, ExteriorAlgebra.ιMulti_zero_apply]
      exact one_mem_logForms_zero v
    | succ m ih =>
      intro w hw
      obtain ⟨S, hS, hSw⟩ := ih (Fin.tail w) fun k ↦ hw _
      have hsucc : ExteriorAlgebra.ιMulti L (m + 1) w =
          ExteriorAlgebra.ι L (w 0) * ExteriorAlgebra.ιMulti L m (Fin.tail w) :=
        ExteriorAlgebra.ιMulti_succ_apply w
      have hS' : ∀ j ∈ S, ∃ k, w k =
          Ring.inverse (algebraMap B L (u j)) • D A L (algebraMap B L (u j)) :=
        fun j hj ↦ (hS j hj).elim fun k hk ↦ ⟨k.succ, hk⟩
      rcases hw 0 with ⟨b, hb⟩ | ⟨j, hj⟩
      · refine ⟨S, hS', ?_⟩
        rw [hsucc, ← mul_smul_comm, ← hb]
        exact ι_mul_mem_logForms (Submodule.subset_span (D_mem_logGenerators v b)) hSw
      · dsimp only at hj
        by_cases hjS : j ∈ S
        · refine ⟨S, hS', ?_⟩
          obtain ⟨k, hk⟩ := hS j hjS
          rw [hsucc, ← hj, ← hk, ι_mul_ιMulti_eq_zero_of_mem_span _
            (Submodule.subset_span ⟨k, rfl⟩), smul_zero]
          exact zero_mem _
        · refine ⟨insert j S, fun j' hj' ↦ ?_, ?_⟩
          · rcases Finset.mem_insert.1 hj' with rfl | hj'
            · exact ⟨0, hj.symm⟩
            · exact hS' j' hj'
          · have heq : algebraMap B L (u j) • w 0 = D A L (algebraMap B L (u j)) := by
              rw [← hj, smul_smul, Ring.mul_inverse_cancel _ (hunit j), one_smul]
            rw [Finset.prod_insert hjS, mul_smul, hsucc, ← mul_smul_comm, ← smul_mul_assoc,
              ← algebraMap_smul L (u j) (ExteriorAlgebra.ι L (w 0)), ← map_smul, heq]
            exact ι_mul_mem_logForms (Submodule.subset_span (D_mem_logGenerators v _)) hSw
  induction hz using Submodule.span_induction with
  | mem z hz =>
    obtain ⟨w, hw, rfl⟩ := hz
    obtain ⟨S, -, hS⟩ := key q w hw
    rw [← Finset.prod_sdiff (Finset.subset_univ S), mul_smul]
    exact Submodule.smul_mem _ _ hS
  | zero => rw [smul_zero]; exact zero_mem _
  | add z z' _ _ h h' => rw [smul_add]; exact add_mem h h'
  | smul c z _ h => rw [smul_comm]; exact Submodule.smul_mem _ c h

/-- **Logarithmic forms are regular after multiplying by the equations of the poles**: for a
logarithmic form `ω` the forms `(∏ⱼ uⱼ) ω` and `(∏ⱼ uⱼ) dω` come from `B`. -/
theorem exists_mapExteriorPower_eq_prod_smul_of_mem_logForms {ι : Type*} [Fintype ι]
    {u : ι → B} (hunit : ∀ j, IsUnit (algebraMap B L (u j))) {q : ℕ} (ω : ⋀[L]^q (Ω[L⁄A]))
    (hω : (ω : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) ∈ logForms A L u q) :
    (∃ η : ⋀[B]^q (Ω[B⁄A]),
      mapExteriorPower A B L q η = algebraMap B L (∏ j, u j) • ω) ∧
    ∃ η : ⋀[B]^(q + 1) (Ω[B⁄A]),
      mapExteriorPower A B L (q + 1) η =
        algebraMap B L (∏ j, u j) • deRhamDifferential (A := A) q ω := by
  constructor
  · refine exists_mapExteriorPower_eq_of_mem_logForms_isEmpty
      (v := (Empty.elim : Empty → B)) _ ?_
    rw [Submodule.coe_smul, algebraMap_smul]
    exact prod_smul_mem_logForms _ hunit hω
  · refine exists_mapExteriorPower_eq_of_mem_logForms_isEmpty
      (v := (Empty.elim : Empty → B)) _ ?_
    rw [Submodule.coe_smul, algebraMap_smul]
    exact prod_smul_mem_logForms _ hunit (coe_deRhamDifferential_mem_logForms u q ω hω)

end Regular'

/-! ### Logarithmic forms under localization -/

section Localization

variable {A B L B' L' : Type u} [CommRing A] [CommRing B] [CommRing L] [CommRing B']
  [CommRing L'] [Algebra A L] [Algebra B L] [Algebra A L'] [Algebra L L'] [IsScalarTower A L L']
  [Algebra B B'] [Algebra B' L']
  (hcomm : ∀ b, algebraMap L L' (algebraMap B L b) = algebraMap B' L' (algebraMap B B' b))

include hcomm

/-- Logarithmic forms go to logarithmic forms along compatible maps `B → B'`, `L → L'`. -/
theorem coe_mapExteriorPower_mem_logForms_map {ι : Type*} (u : ι → B)
    (hunit : ∀ j, IsUnit (algebraMap B L (u j))) {m : ℕ} (y : ⋀[L]^m (Ω[L⁄A]))
    (hy : (y : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) ∈ logForms A L u m) :
    ((mapExteriorPower A L L' m y : ⋀[L']^m (Ω[L'⁄A])) : ExteriorAlgebra L' (Ω[L'⁄A])) ∈
      logForms A L' (fun j ↦ algebraMap B B' (u j)) m := by
  let S : Submodule B (⋀[L]^m (Ω[L⁄A])) :=
    { carrier := {y | ((mapExteriorPower A L L' m y : ⋀[L']^m (Ω[L'⁄A])) :
        ExteriorAlgebra L' (Ω[L'⁄A])) ∈ logForms A L' (fun j ↦ algebraMap B B' (u j)) m}
      zero_mem' := by
        simp only [Set.mem_ofPred_eq, map_zero, ZeroMemClass.coe_zero]
        exact zero_mem _
      add_mem' := by
        intro a b ha hb
        simp only [Set.mem_ofPred_eq, map_add, Submodule.coe_add] at ha hb ⊢
        exact add_mem ha hb
      smul_mem' := by
        intro c a ha
        simp only [Set.mem_ofPred_eq] at ha ⊢
        rw [← algebraMap_smul L c a, map_smul, Submodule.coe_smul_of_tower,
          ← algebraMap_smul L', hcomm, algebraMap_smul]
        exact Submodule.smul_mem _ _ ha }
  refine mem_of_mem_logForms S (fun v hv ↦ ?_) y hy
  change ((mapExteriorPower A L L' m (exteriorPower.ιMulti L m v) : ⋀[L']^m (Ω[L'⁄A])) :
    ExteriorAlgebra L' (Ω[L'⁄A])) ∈ logForms A L' (fun j ↦ algebraMap B B' (u j)) m
  rw [mapExteriorPower_ιMulti, exteriorPower.ιMulti_apply_coe]
  refine ιMulti_mem_logForms _ fun i ↦ ?_
  rcases hv i with ⟨b, hb⟩ | ⟨j, hj⟩
  · rw [← hb, map_D, hcomm]
    exact D_mem_logGenerators _ _
  · rw [← hj]
    dsimp only
    rw [map_smul, map_D, hcomm, ← algebraMap_smul L', map_ringInverse_of_isUnit _ (hunit j), hcomm]
    exact dlog_mem_logGenerators _ j

omit [IsScalarTower A L L'] in
/-- `γᴺ d(β) ∈ d B`-combinations, for `β ∈ B'` and `γ` the image of `g`. -/
theorem exists_pow_smul_D_eq_map (g : B) [IsLocalization.Away g B'] [IsScalarTower A L L']
    {ι : Type*} (u : ι → B) (b' : B') :
    ∃ (N : ℕ) (w : Ω[L⁄A]), w ∈ Submodule.span B (logGenerators A L u) ∧
      algebraMap B' L' (algebraMap B B' g) ^ N • D A L' (algebraMap B' L' b') = map A A L L' w := by
  obtain ⟨K, b, hb⟩ := IsLocalization.Away.surj g b'
  set γ : L' := algebraMap B' L' (algebraMap B B' g)
  have hβ : algebraMap B' L' b' * γ ^ K = algebraMap L L' (algebraMap B L b) := by
    rw [hcomm, ← hb, map_mul, map_pow]
  have h1 : algebraMap B L g ^ K • D A L (algebraMap B L b) ∈
      Submodule.span B (logGenerators A L u) := by
    rw [← map_pow, algebraMap_smul]
    exact Submodule.smul_mem _ _ (Submodule.subset_span (D_mem_logGenerators u b))
  have h2 : algebraMap B L b • D A L (algebraMap B L (g ^ K)) ∈
      Submodule.span B (logGenerators A L u) := by
    rw [algebraMap_smul]
    exact Submodule.smul_mem _ _ (Submodule.subset_span (D_mem_logGenerators u _))
  refine ⟨K + K, _, sub_mem h1 h2, ?_⟩
  have e1 : algebraMap L L' (algebraMap B L g) = γ := hcomm g
  have e3 : algebraMap L L' (algebraMap B L g ^ K) = γ ^ K := by rw [RingHom.map_pow, e1]
  have e2 : algebraMap L L' (algebraMap B L (g ^ K)) = γ ^ K := by rw [RingHom.map_pow, e3]
  rw [map_sub, map_smul, map_smul, map_D, map_D, ← algebraMap_smul L' (algebraMap B L g ^ K),
    ← algebraMap_smul L' (algebraMap B L b), e3, e2, ← hβ, Derivation.leibniz, smul_add,
    smul_smul, smul_smul, pow_add, mul_comm (γ ^ K) (algebraMap B' L' b')]
  abel

omit [IsScalarTower A L L'] in
/-- **Logarithmic forms on a localization `B'` of `B` away from `g` come from `B`**, up to a
power of `g`. -/
theorem exists_pow_smul_eq_mapExteriorPower (g : B) [IsLocalization.Away g B']
    [IsScalarTower A L L'] {ι : Type*} (u : ι → B) (hunit : ∀ j, IsUnit (algebraMap B L (u j)))
    {m : ℕ} (z : ⋀[L']^m (Ω[L'⁄A]))
    (hz : (z : ExteriorAlgebra L' (Ω[L'⁄A])) ∈ logForms A L' (fun j ↦ algebraMap B B' (u j)) m) :
    ∃ (N : ℕ) (y : ⋀[L]^m (Ω[L⁄A])), (y : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) ∈ logForms A L u m ∧
      algebraMap B' L' (algebraMap B B' g) ^ N • z = mapExteriorPower A L L' m y := by
  set γ : L' := algebraMap B' L' (algebraMap B B' g)
  let S : Submodule B' (⋀[L']^m (Ω[L'⁄A])) :=
    { carrier := {z | ∃ (N : ℕ) (y : ⋀[L]^m (Ω[L⁄A])),
        (y : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄A])) ∈ logForms A L u m ∧
        γ ^ N • z = mapExteriorPower A L L' m y}
      zero_mem' := ⟨0, 0, by simp only [ZeroMemClass.coe_zero]; exact zero_mem _, by simp⟩
      add_mem' := by
        rintro a b ⟨N, y, hy, ha⟩ ⟨N', y', hy', hb⟩
        refine ⟨N + N', algebraMap B L g ^ N' • y + algebraMap B L g ^ N • y', ?_, ?_⟩
        · rw [Submodule.coe_add, Submodule.coe_smul, Submodule.coe_smul, ← map_pow, ← map_pow,
            algebraMap_smul, algebraMap_smul]
          exact add_mem (Submodule.smul_mem _ _ hy) (Submodule.smul_mem _ _ hy')
        · have e3 : ∀ M, algebraMap L L' (algebraMap B L g ^ M) = γ ^ M := fun M ↦ by
            rw [RingHom.map_pow, hcomm]
          rw [map_add, map_smul, map_smul, ← ha, ← hb,
            ← algebraMap_smul L' (algebraMap B L g ^ N'),
            ← algebraMap_smul L' (algebraMap B L g ^ N),
            e3, e3, smul_smul, smul_smul, smul_add, ← pow_add, ← pow_add, add_comm N' N]
      smul_mem' := by
        rintro c a ⟨N, y, hy, ha⟩
        obtain ⟨K, b, hb⟩ := IsLocalization.Away.surj g c
        refine ⟨N + K, algebraMap B L b • y, ?_, ?_⟩
        · rw [Submodule.coe_smul, algebraMap_smul]
          exact Submodule.smul_mem _ _ hy
        · calc γ ^ (N + K) • (c • a) = (algebraMap B' L' c * γ ^ K) • (γ ^ N • a) := by
                rw [← algebraMap_smul L' c a, smul_smul, smul_smul, pow_add]
                congr 1
                ring
            _ = algebraMap B' L' (algebraMap B B' b) • mapExteriorPower A L L' m y := by
                rw [ha, ← hb, map_mul, RingHom.map_pow]
            _ = _ := by
                rw [map_smul, ← algebraMap_smul L' (algebraMap B L b), hcomm] }
  have hgen : ∀ w ∈ logGenerators A L' (fun j ↦ algebraMap B B' (u j)), ∃ (N : ℕ) (w₀ : Ω[L⁄A]),
      w₀ ∈ Submodule.span B (logGenerators A L u) ∧ γ ^ N • w = map A A L L' w₀ := by
    rintro w (⟨b', rfl⟩ | ⟨j, rfl⟩)
    · exact exists_pow_smul_D_eq_map hcomm g u b'
    · refine ⟨0, Ring.inverse (algebraMap B L (u j)) • D A L (algebraMap B L (u j)),
        Submodule.subset_span (dlog_mem_logGenerators u j), ?_⟩
      dsimp only
      rw [pow_zero, one_smul, map_smul, map_D, hcomm,
        ← algebraMap_smul L' (Ring.inverse (algebraMap B L (u j))),
        map_ringInverse_of_isUnit _ (hunit j), hcomm]
  refine mem_of_mem_logForms S (fun v hv ↦ ?_) z hz
  choose N w hw hN using fun i ↦ hgen _ (hv i)
  refine ⟨∑ i, N i, exteriorPower.ιMulti L m w, ?_, ?_⟩
  · rw [exteriorPower.ιMulti_apply_coe]
    exact ιMulti_mem_logForms_of_mem_span w hw
  · rw [mapExteriorPower_ιMulti, ← Finset.prod_pow_eq_pow_sum, ← AlternatingMap.map_smul_univ]
    congr 1
    funext i
    exact hN i

omit hcomm in
/-- The exterior powers of the differentials of a localization `L'` of `L` are the localization
of those of `L`. -/
theorem isLocalizedModule_mapExteriorPower_of_isLocalization (M : Submonoid L)
    [IsLocalization M L'] (m : ℕ) :
    IsLocalizedModule M (mapExteriorPower A L L' m) :=
  IsLocalization.isLocalizedModule_of_exteriorPower L' (map A A L L') m M _
    (mapExteriorPower_ιMulti A L L' m)

end Localization

/-! ### Coordinates prime to each other on an étale chart -/

section Flat

/-- If `s` is a nonzerodivisor of `R` and `r` is a nonzerodivisor modulo `s`, the same holds for
their images in a flat `R`-algebra: `s ∣ r a` implies `s ∣ a`. -/
theorem dvd_of_dvd_mul_of_flat {R S : Type*} [CommRing R] [CommRing S] [Algebra R S]
    [Module.Flat R S] {r s : R} (hs : IsSMulRegular R s) (hr : ∀ a, s ∣ r * a → s ∣ a) (a : S)
    (h : algebraMap R S s ∣ algebraMap R S r * a) : algebraMap R S s ∣ a := by
  have reg : RingTheory.Sequence.IsWeaklyRegular R [s, r] := by
    rw [RingTheory.Sequence.isWeaklyRegular_cons_iff,
      RingTheory.Sequence.isWeaklyRegular_singleton_iff]
    refine ⟨hs, fun x y hxy ↦ ?_⟩
    obtain ⟨x, rfl⟩ := Submodule.Quotient.mk_surjective _ x
    obtain ⟨y, rfl⟩ := Submodule.Quotient.mk_surjective _ y
    simp only [← Submodule.Quotient.mk_smul, Submodule.Quotient.eq] at hxy ⊢
    obtain ⟨b, -, hb⟩ := (Submodule.mem_smul_pointwise_iff_exists _ _ _).1 hxy
    obtain ⟨c, hc⟩ := hr (x - y) ⟨b, by rw [mul_sub, ← smul_eq_mul, ← smul_eq_mul, ← hb,
      smul_eq_mul]⟩
    exact (Submodule.mem_smul_pointwise_iff_exists _ _ _).2 ⟨c, Submodule.mem_top, hc.symm⟩
  have reg' := reg.of_flat (S := S)
  simp only [List.map_cons, List.map_nil, RingTheory.Sequence.isWeaklyRegular_cons_iff] at reg'
  obtain ⟨c, hc⟩ := h
  have key : algebraMap R S r • (Submodule.Quotient.mk a : QuotSMulTop (algebraMap R S s) S) =
      algebraMap R S r • Submodule.Quotient.mk 0 := by
    rw [← Submodule.Quotient.mk_smul, ← Submodule.Quotient.mk_smul, Submodule.Quotient.eq,
      smul_zero, sub_zero, smul_eq_mul, hc]
    exact (Submodule.mem_smul_pointwise_iff_exists _ _ _).2 ⟨c, Submodule.mem_top, rfl⟩
  have := reg'.2.1 key
  rw [Submodule.Quotient.eq, sub_zero] at this
  obtain ⟨b, -, hb⟩ := (Submodule.mem_smul_pointwise_iff_exists _ _ _).1 this
  exact ⟨b, hb.symm⟩

/-- Each variable `Xᵢ` is a nonzerodivisor of the polynomial ring `k[X_σ]`. -/
theorem isSMulRegular_mvPolynomial_X {σ k : Type*} [Field k] (i : σ) :
    IsSMulRegular (MvPolynomial σ k) (MvPolynomial.X i : MvPolynomial σ k) :=
  fun _ _ h ↦ mul_left_cancel₀ (MvPolynomial.X_ne_zero (R := k) i) h

end Flat

/-! ### Deligne's criterion on an étale chart -/

section Chart

variable {k B L : Type u} [Field k] [CommRing B] [CommRing L] [Algebra k B] [Algebra k L]
  [Algebra B L] [IsScalarTower k B L] {n : ℕ} (x : Fin n → B)
  [Algebra (MvPolynomial (Fin n) k) B] [IsScalarTower k (MvPolynomial (Fin n) k) B]
  [Algebra.Etale (MvPolynomial (Fin n) k) B]
  (hx : ∀ i, algebraMap (MvPolynomial (Fin n) k) B (MvPolynomial.X i) = x i)
  {κ : Type*} [Fintype κ] {ε : κ → Fin n} (hε : Function.Injective ε)
  (c : B) (hc : IsUnit c) (f : B) (hf : f = c * ∏ j, x (ε j)) [IsLocalization.Away f L]

include hx hε hc hf

/-- **Deligne's criterion on an étale chart.** Let `B` be étale over `k[x₁, …, xₙ]` and
`L = B[1/f]` with `f = c ∏ⱼ x_{ε j}`, `c` a unit. A form `ω` on `L` with `f ω` and `f dω` without
poles has logarithmic poles along the `x_{ε j}`. -/
theorem coe_mem_logForms_of_etale {q : ℕ} (ω : ⋀[L]^q (Ω[L⁄k]))
    (hA : ((algebraMap B L f • ω : ⋀[L]^q (Ω[L⁄k])) : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄k])) ∈
      logForms k L (fun j : (∅ : Finset κ) ↦ x (ε j)) q)
    (hB : ((algebraMap B L f • deRhamDifferential (A := k) q ω : ⋀[L]^(q + 1) (Ω[L⁄k])) :
      ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄k])) ∈ logForms k L (fun j : (∅ : Finset κ) ↦ x (ε j)) (q + 1)) :
    (ω : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄k])) ∈ logForms k L (fun j ↦ x (ε j)) q := by
  let bB : Module.Basis (Fin n) B (Ω[B⁄k]) :=
    (Algebra.TensorProduct.basis B (mvPolynomialBasis k (Fin n))).map
      (tensorKaehlerEquivOfFormallyEtale k (MvPolynomial (Fin n) k) B)
  have hbB : ∀ i, bB i = D k B (x i) := by
    intro i
    simp only [bB, Module.Basis.map_apply, Algebra.TensorProduct.basis_apply,
      tensorKaehlerEquivOfFormallyEtale_apply, mvPolynomialBasis_apply]
    rw [mapBaseChange_tmul, one_smul, map_D, hx]
  have : Algebra.FormallyEtale B L := Algebra.FormallyEtale.of_isLocalization (Submonoid.powers f)
  let bL : Module.Basis (Fin n) L (Ω[L⁄k]) :=
    (Algebra.TensorProduct.basis L bB).map (tensorKaehlerEquivOfFormallyEtale k B L)
  have hD : ∀ b, D k L (algebraMap B L b) =
      tensorKaehlerEquivOfFormallyEtale k B L ((1 : L) ⊗ₜ D k B b) := by
    intro b
    rw [tensorKaehlerEquivOfFormallyEtale_apply, mapBaseChange_tmul, one_smul, map_D]
  have hbL : ∀ i, bL i = D k L (algebraMap B L (x i)) := by
    intro i
    rw [hD, ← hbB]
    simp only [bL, Module.Basis.map_apply, Algebra.TensorProduct.basis_apply]
  have hcoord : ∀ (b : B) j, bL.repr (D k L (algebraMap B L b)) j ∈
      Set.range (algebraMap B L) := by
    intro b j
    refine ⟨bB.repr (D k B b) j, ?_⟩
    rw [hD]
    simp only [bL, Module.Basis.map_repr, LinearEquiv.trans_apply, LinearEquiv.symm_apply_apply,
      Algebra.TensorProduct.basis_repr_tmul, one_smul, Finsupp.mapRange_apply]
  have hreg : ∀ i, IsSMulRegular B (x i) := fun i ↦ hx i ▸ (isSMulRegular_mvPolynomial_X i).of_flat
  have hcop : ∀ j j', j ≠ j' → ∀ r, x (ε j) ∣ x (ε j') * r → x (ε j) ∣ r := by
    intro j j' hjj' r h
    rw [← hx, ← hx] at h
    rw [← hx]
    exact dvd_of_dvd_mul_of_flat (isSMulRegular_mvPolynomial_X _)
      (fun a ha ↦ (MvPolynomial.X_prime.dvd_or_dvd ha).resolve_left
        (fun h' ↦ hjj' (hε (MvPolynomial.X_dvd_X.1 h')))) r h
  have hfreg : IsSMulRegular B f := by
    rw [hf]
    refine (hc.isSMulRegular B).mul ?_
    exact Finset.prod_induction _ (IsSMulRegular B) (fun a b ha hb ↦ ha.mul hb)
      (isUnit_one.isSMulRegular B) (fun j _ ↦ hreg _)
  have hinj : Function.Injective (algebraMap B L) := by
    rw [injective_iff_map_eq_zero]
    intro b hb
    obtain ⟨⟨_, N, rfl⟩, hm⟩ := (IsLocalization.map_eq_zero_iff (Submonoid.powers f) L b).1 hb
    exact (hfreg.pow N) (show f ^ N • b = f ^ N • (0 : B) by rw [smul_zero, smul_eq_mul]; exact hm)
  have hunit : ∀ j, IsUnit (algebraMap B L (x (ε j))) := by
    intro j
    refine isUnit_of_dvd_unit (map_dvd (algebraMap B L) ?_)
      (IsLocalization.Away.algebraMap_isUnit f)
    rw [hf]
    exact Dvd.dvd.mul_left (Finset.dvd_prod_of_mem _ (Finset.mem_univ j)) c
  subst hf
  exact coe_mem_logForms_of_smul_mem hbL hcoord hinj hε (u := fun j ↦ x (ε j)) (fun j ↦ rfl)
    hcop hunit c hc ω hA hB

end Chart

/-! ### Deligne's criterion on a smooth algebra with a simple normal crossing family -/

section Global

variable {k B L : Type u} [Field k] [CommRing B] [CommRing L] [Algebra k B] [Algebra k L]
  [Algebra B L] [IsScalarTower k B L] {ι : Type*} [Fintype ι] {t : ι → B}
  [IsLocalization.Away (∏ j, t j) L]

/-- **Deligne's criterion on an étale chart of `B`.** Let `B'` be a localization of `B` away
from `g`, étale over `k[x₁, …, xₙ]`, on which `∏ⱼ tⱼ` is a unit `c` times `∏_{j ∈ κ} x_{ε j}`
with each `x_{ε j}` some `tᵢ`. If `f ω` and `f dω` have no poles, for `f = ∏ⱼ tⱼ`, then some
power of `g` carries `ω` into the logarithmic forms. -/
theorem exists_pow_smul_mem_logForms_of_etale (B' L₂ : Type u) [CommRing B'] [CommRing L₂]
    [Algebra B B'] [Algebra k B'] [IsScalarTower k B B'] [Algebra B' L₂] [Algebra k L₂]
    [IsScalarTower k B' L₂] [Algebra B L₂] [IsScalarTower B B' L₂] (g : B)
    [IsLocalization.Away g B'] [IsLocalization.Away (algebraMap B B' (∏ j, t j)) L₂]
    {n : ℕ} (x : Fin n → B') [Algebra (MvPolynomial (Fin n) k) B']
    [IsScalarTower k (MvPolynomial (Fin n) k) B'] [Algebra.Etale (MvPolynomial (Fin n) k) B']
    (hx : ∀ i, algebraMap (MvPolynomial (Fin n) k) B' (MvPolynomial.X i) = x i)
    {κ : Type*} [Fintype κ] {ε : κ → Fin n} (hε : Function.Injective ε) (c : B')
    (hc : IsUnit c) (hf : algebraMap B B' (∏ j, t j) = c * ∏ j, x (ε j))
    (hxt : ∀ j, ∃ i, algebraMap B B' (t i) = x (ε j)) {q : ℕ} (ω : ⋀[L]^q (Ω[L⁄k]))
    (hA : ((algebraMap B L (∏ j, t j) • ω : ⋀[L]^q (Ω[L⁄k])) : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄k])) ∈
      logForms k L (Empty.elim : Empty → B) q)
    (hB : ((algebraMap B L (∏ j, t j) • deRhamDifferential (A := k) q ω :
      ⋀[L]^(q + 1) (Ω[L⁄k])) : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄k])) ∈
        logForms k L (Empty.elim : Empty → B) (q + 1)) :
    ∃ N : ℕ, g ^ N • (ω : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄k])) ∈ logForms k L t q := by
  classical
  -- `L₂` as a localization of `L`
  have hu : IsUnit (algebraMap B L₂ (∏ j, t j)) := by
    rw [IsScalarTower.algebraMap_apply B B' L₂]
    exact IsLocalization.Away.algebraMap_isUnit _
  let : Algebra L L₂ := (IsLocalization.Away.lift (∏ j, t j) hu).toAlgebra
  have hlift : ∀ b, algebraMap L L₂ (algebraMap B L b) = algebraMap B L₂ b :=
    IsLocalization.Away.lift_eq _ hu
  have : IsScalarTower B L L₂ := IsScalarTower.of_algebraMap_eq fun b ↦ (hlift b).symm
  have : IsScalarTower k L L₂ := IsScalarTower.of_algebraMap_eq fun a ↦ by
    rw [IsScalarTower.algebraMap_apply k B L, hlift, IsScalarTower.algebraMap_apply B B' L₂,
      ← IsScalarTower.algebraMap_apply k B B', ← IsScalarTower.algebraMap_apply k B' L₂]
  have : IsLocalization.Away (algebraMap B L g) L₂ :=
    IsLocalization.Away.commutes L B' L₂ (∏ j, t j) g
  have hcomm : ∀ b, algebraMap L L₂ (algebraMap B L b) = algebraMap B' L₂ (algebraMap B B' b) :=
    fun b ↦ by rw [hlift, ← IsScalarTower.algebraMap_apply]
  have hmapsmul : ∀ {m : ℕ} (z : ⋀[L]^m (Ω[L⁄k])),
      mapExteriorPower k L L₂ m (algebraMap B L (∏ j, t j) • z) =
        algebraMap B' L₂ (algebraMap B B' (∏ j, t j)) • mapExteriorPower k L L₂ m z := by
    intro m z
    rw [map_smul, ← algebraMap_smul L₂ (algebraMap B L (∏ j, t j)), hcomm]
  -- transport of the hypotheses
  have hA₂ := coe_mapExteriorPower_mem_logForms_map hcomm (Empty.elim : Empty → B)
    (fun j ↦ isEmptyElim j) _ hA
  have hB₂ := coe_mapExteriorPower_mem_logForms_map hcomm (Empty.elim : Empty → B)
    (fun j ↦ isEmptyElim j) _ hB
  rw [hmapsmul, logForms_isEmpty_eq _ (fun j : (∅ : Finset κ) ↦ x (ε j))] at hA₂
  rw [hmapsmul, mapExteriorPower_deRhamDifferential,
    logForms_isEmpty_eq _ (fun j : (∅ : Finset κ) ↦ x (ε j))] at hB₂
  have hlog := coe_mem_logForms_of_etale (L := L₂) x hx hε c hc _ hf _ hA₂ hB₂
  have hlog' : ((mapExteriorPower k L L₂ q ω : ⋀[L₂]^q (Ω[L₂⁄k])) :
      ExteriorAlgebra L₂ (Ω[L₂⁄k])) ∈ logForms k L₂ (fun j ↦ algebraMap B B' (t j)) q :=
    logForms_mono hxt q hlog
  have hunitL : ∀ j, IsUnit (algebraMap B L (t j)) := fun j ↦
    isUnit_of_dvd_unit (map_dvd _ (Finset.dvd_prod_of_mem _ (Finset.mem_univ j)))
      (IsLocalization.Away.algebraMap_isUnit _)
  obtain ⟨N, y, hy, hN⟩ := exists_pow_smul_eq_mapExteriorPower hcomm g t hunitL _ hlog'
  have hloc := isLocalizedModule_mapExteriorPower_of_isLocalization (A := k) (L' := L₂)
    (Submonoid.powers (algebraMap B L g)) q
  have h0 : mapExteriorPower k L L₂ q (algebraMap B L g ^ N • ω - y) = 0 := by
    rw [map_sub, map_smul, ← hN, ← algebraMap_smul L₂ (algebraMap B L g ^ N), RingHom.map_pow,
      hcomm, sub_self]
  obtain ⟨⟨_, K, rfl⟩, hK⟩ :=
    (IsLocalizedModule.eq_zero_iff (Submonoid.powers (algebraMap B L g)) _).1 h0
  refine ⟨K + N, ?_⟩
  have hK' := congrArg (fun z : ⋀[L]^q (Ω[L⁄k]) ↦ (z : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄k]))) hK
  simp only [Submonoid.smul_def, smul_sub, Submodule.coe_sub, ZeroMemClass.coe_zero, sub_eq_zero,
    smul_smul, ← pow_add, ← map_pow, algebraMap_smul] at hK'
  rw [← Submodule.coe_smul_of_tower, hK', Submodule.coe_smul_of_tower]
  exact Submodule.smul_mem _ _ hy

/-- **Deligne's criterion near a prime.** Let `B` be smooth over `k`, `t : ι → B` a simple normal
crossing family and `L = B[1/∏ⱼ tⱼ]`. If `f ω` and `f dω` have no poles, for `f = ∏ⱼ tⱼ`, then
near every prime `𝔭` some power of an element `g ∉ 𝔭` carries `ω` into the logarithmic forms. -/
theorem exists_pow_smul_mem_logForms_of_prod_smul_mem [Algebra.Smooth k B]
    (hS : ∀ 𝔭 : PrimeSpectrum B,
      LinearIndependent 𝔭.asIdeal.ResidueField
        (fun j : {j : ι // t j ∈ 𝔭.asIdeal} ↦
          ((1 : 𝔭.asIdeal.ResidueField) ⊗ₜ[B] D k B (t j) :
            𝔭.asIdeal.ResidueField ⊗[B] Ω[B⁄k])))
    (𝔭 : PrimeSpectrum B) {q : ℕ} (ω : ⋀[L]^q (Ω[L⁄k]))
    (hA : ((algebraMap B L (∏ j, t j) • ω : ⋀[L]^q (Ω[L⁄k])) : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄k])) ∈
      logForms k L (Empty.elim : Empty → B) q)
    (hB : ((algebraMap B L (∏ j, t j) • deRhamDifferential (A := k) q ω :
      ⋀[L]^(q + 1) (Ω[L⁄k])) : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄k])) ∈
        logForms k L (Empty.elim : Empty → B) (q + 1)) :
    ∃ g ∉ 𝔭.asIdeal, ∃ N : ℕ, g ^ N • (ω : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄k])) ∈ logForms k L t q := by
  classical
  obtain ⟨g₀, hg₀, n, s, ε, hεs, het⟩ := exists_etale_mvPolynomial_fin t hS 𝔭
  obtain ⟨h, hh⟩ : ∃ h : B, h = ∏ j : {j // t j ∉ 𝔭.asIdeal}, t j := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  have hh𝔭 : h ∉ 𝔭.asIdeal := by
    rw [hh, Ideal.IsPrime.prod_mem_iff]
    rintro ⟨j, -, hj⟩
    exact j.2 hj
  have hg𝔭 : g₀ * h ∉ 𝔭.asIdeal := fun hmem ↦
    ((Ideal.IsPrime.mem_or_mem inferInstance hmem).elim hg₀ hh𝔭)
  let B₀ := Localization.Away g₀
  let B' := Localization.Away (algebraMap B B₀ h)
  let P := MvPolynomial (Fin n) k
  let : Algebra P B₀ := (MvPolynomial.aeval fun i ↦ algebraMap B B₀ (s i)).toRingHom.toAlgebra
  have : Algebra.Etale P B₀ := RingHom.etale_algebraMap.1 het
  have : IsScalarTower k P B₀ := IsScalarTower.of_algebraMap_eq fun c ↦ by
    change _ = MvPolynomial.aeval _ (MvPolynomial.C c)
    rw [MvPolynomial.aeval_C]
  have : Algebra.Etale B₀ B' := Algebra.Etale.of_isLocalizationAway (algebraMap B B₀ h)
  have : Algebra.Etale P B' := Algebra.Etale.comp P B₀ B'
  have : IsScalarTower k P B' := IsScalarTower.of_algebraMap_eq fun c ↦ by
    rw [IsScalarTower.algebraMap_apply P B₀ B', ← IsScalarTower.algebraMap_apply k P B₀,
      ← IsScalarTower.algebraMap_apply]
  have : IsLocalization.Away (g₀ * h) B' := IsLocalization.Away.mul' (S := B₀) B' g₀ h
  have hx : ∀ i, algebraMap P B' (MvPolynomial.X i) = algebraMap B B' (s i) := by
    intro i
    rw [IsScalarTower.algebraMap_apply P B₀ B']
    change algebraMap B₀ B' (MvPolynomial.aeval _ (MvPolynomial.X i)) = _
    rw [MvPolynomial.aeval_X, ← IsScalarTower.algebraMap_apply]
  have hc : IsUnit (∏ j : {j // t j ∉ 𝔭.asIdeal}, algebraMap B B' (t j)) := by
    rw [← map_prod, ← hh, IsScalarTower.algebraMap_apply B B₀ B']
    exact IsLocalization.Away.algebraMap_isUnit _
  have hf : algebraMap B B' (∏ j, t j) = (∏ j : {j // t j ∉ 𝔭.asIdeal}, algebraMap B B' (t j)) *
      ∏ j : {j // t j ∈ 𝔭.asIdeal}, algebraMap B B' (s (ε j)) := by
    simp only [hεs, map_prod]
    exact (Fintype.prod_subtype_mul_prod_subtype _ _).symm.trans (mul_comm _ _)
  obtain ⟨N, hN⟩ := exists_pow_smul_mem_logForms_of_etale B'
    (Localization.Away (algebraMap B B' (∏ j, t j))) (g₀ * h) (fun i ↦ algebraMap B B' (s i))
    hx ε.injective _ hc hf (fun j ↦ ⟨j.1, by rw [hεs]⟩) ω hA hB
  exact ⟨g₀ * h, hg𝔭, N, hN⟩

/-- **Deligne's criterion for logarithmic poles** (Hodge II 3.1). Let `B` be smooth over a field
`k`, let `t : ι → B` be a finite family such that at every prime `𝔭` the differentials of the
`tⱼ ∈ 𝔭` are independent in `κ(𝔭) ⊗ Ω[B⁄k]`, and let `L = B[1/f]`, `f = ∏ⱼ tⱼ`. A form `ω` on
`L` has logarithmic poles along the `tⱼ` if and only if `f ω` and `f dω` come from `B`. -/
theorem coe_mem_logForms_iff [Algebra.Smooth k B]
    (hS : ∀ 𝔭 : PrimeSpectrum B,
      LinearIndependent 𝔭.asIdeal.ResidueField
        (fun j : {j : ι // t j ∈ 𝔭.asIdeal} ↦
          ((1 : 𝔭.asIdeal.ResidueField) ⊗ₜ[B] D k B (t j) :
            𝔭.asIdeal.ResidueField ⊗[B] Ω[B⁄k])))
    {q : ℕ} (ω : ⋀[L]^q (Ω[L⁄k])) :
    (ω : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄k])) ∈ logForms k L t q ↔
      (∃ η : ⋀[B]^q (Ω[B⁄k]),
        mapExteriorPower k B L q η = algebraMap B L (∏ j, t j) • ω) ∧
      ∃ η : ⋀[B]^(q + 1) (Ω[B⁄k]),
        mapExteriorPower k B L (q + 1) η =
          algebraMap B L (∏ j, t j) • deRhamDifferential (A := k) q ω := by
  have hunitL : ∀ j, IsUnit (algebraMap B L (t j)) := fun j ↦
    isUnit_of_dvd_unit (map_dvd _ (Finset.dvd_prod_of_mem _ (Finset.mem_univ j)))
      (IsLocalization.Away.algebraMap_isUnit _)
  refine ⟨exists_mapExteriorPower_eq_prod_smul_of_mem_logForms hunitL ω, ?_⟩
  rintro ⟨⟨η, hη⟩, ⟨η', hη'⟩⟩
  have hA := coe_mapExteriorPower_base_mem_logForms (L := L) (Empty.elim : Empty → B) η
  have hB := coe_mapExteriorPower_base_mem_logForms (L := L) (Empty.elim : Empty → B) η'
  rw [hη] at hA
  rw [hη'] at hB
  let I : Ideal B := (logForms k L t q).comap
    (LinearMap.toSpanSingleton B _ (ω : ExteriorAlgebra L (Ω[L⁄k])))
  have hI : I = ⊤ := by
    by_contra hI
    obtain ⟨M, hM, hIM⟩ := Ideal.exists_le_maximal I hI
    obtain ⟨g, hg, N, hN⟩ :=
      exists_pow_smul_mem_logForms_of_prod_smul_mem hS ⟨M, hM.isPrime⟩ ω hA hB
    exact hg (hM.isPrime.mem_of_pow_mem N (hIM hN))
  simpa [I] using (hI ▸ Submodule.mem_top : (1 : B) ∈ I)

end Global

/-! ### The criterion on an affine chart of a smooth `k`-scheme -/

section Scheme

open CategoryTheory Opposite AlgebraicGeometry

variable {k : Type u} [Field k] {V : Scheme.{u}} (f : V ⟶ Spec (.of k))

/-- An open `O ⊆ W` equal to the basic open `D(b)` of an affine open `W` is affine. -/
theorem isAffineOpen_of_eq_basicOpen {W : V.affineOpens} (b : Γ(V, W)) {O : V.Opens}
    (hO : O = V.basicOpen b) : IsAffineOpen O :=
  hO ▸ W.2.basicOpen b

/-- **The sections over an open equal to a basic open `D(b)` of an affine open are the
localization away from `b`.** -/
theorem isLocalization_away_of_eq_basicOpen {W : V.affineOpens} (b : Γ(V, W)) {O : V.Opens}
    (hO : O = V.basicOpen b) (hle : O ≤ W) :
    letI : Algebra Γ(V, W) Γ(V, O) := (V.presheaf.map (homOfLE hle).op).hom.toAlgebra
    IsLocalization.Away b Γ(V, O) := by
  subst hO
  exact W.2.isLocalization_basicOpen b

/-- On affine opens `O ⊆ W`, a section `θ` of `Ω^p` over `O` times the restriction of `r` extends
over `W` exactly when the algebraic form `r θ` comes from `Γ(V, W)`. -/
theorem exists_presheaf_map_eq_smul_iff (p : ℕ) {W : V.affineOpens} {O : V.Opens}
    (hO : IsAffineOpen O) (h : O ≤ W) (r : Γ(V, W))
    (θ : Γ(f.relativeDifferentialForms (p : ℤ), O)) :
    (∃ η : Γ(f.relativeDifferentialForms (p : ℤ), W),
      (f.relativeDifferentialForms (p : ℤ)).presheaf.map (homOfLE h).op η =
        V.presheaf.map (homOfLE h).op r • θ) ↔
      letI := MMP.Mori.sectionAlgebra f W
      letI := MMP.Mori.sectionAlgebra f O
      letI : Algebra Γ(V, W) Γ(V, O) := (V.presheaf.map (homOfLE h).op).hom.toAlgebra
      haveI := MMP.Flips.ResolutionInputs.isScalarTower_section_res f h
      ∃ η : ⋀[Γ(V, W)]^p (Ω[Γ(V, W)⁄k]),
        mapExteriorPower k Γ(V, W) Γ(V, O) p η = algebraMap Γ(V, W) Γ(V, O) r •
          formsAlgEquiv f p ⟨O, hO⟩ θ := by
  let := MMP.Mori.sectionAlgebra f W
  let := MMP.Mori.sectionAlgebra f O
  let : Algebra Γ(V, W) Γ(V, O) := (V.presheaf.map (homOfLE h).op).hom.toAlgebra
  have := MMP.Flips.ResolutionInputs.isScalarTower_section_res f h
  constructor
  · rintro ⟨η, hη⟩
    refine ⟨formsAlgEquiv f p W η, ?_⟩
    rw [← formsAlgEquiv_restrict f p (W' := ⟨O, hO⟩) h, hη, LinearEquiv.map_smul]
    rfl
  · rintro ⟨η, hη⟩
    refine ⟨(formsAlgEquiv f p W).symm η, (formsAlgEquiv f p ⟨O, hO⟩).injective ?_⟩
    rw [formsAlgEquiv_restrict f p (W' := ⟨O, hO⟩) h, LinearEquiv.apply_symm_apply, hη,
      LinearEquiv.map_smul]
    rfl

private theorem modules_map_homOfLE_self (F : V.Modules) {O : V.Opens} (h : O ≤ O)
    (s : Γ(F, O)) : F.presheaf.map (homOfLE h).op s = s := by
  rw [show (homOfLE h).op = 𝟙 (op O) from rfl, F.presheaf.map_id]
  rfl

private theorem modules_map_homOfLE_comp (F : V.Modules) {O₁ O₂ O₃ : V.Opens} (h₁ : O₂ ≤ O₁)
    (h₂ : O₃ ≤ O₂) (s : Γ(F, O₁)) :
    F.presheaf.map (homOfLE h₂).op (F.presheaf.map (homOfLE h₁).op s) =
      F.presheaf.map (homOfLE (h₂.trans h₁)).op s := by
  rw [← ConcreteCategory.comp_apply, ← Functor.map_comp]
  rfl

private theorem presheaf_map_homOfLE_comp {O₁ O₂ O₃ : V.Opens} (h₁ : O₂ ≤ O₁) (h₂ : O₃ ≤ O₂)
    (a : Γ(V, O₁)) : V.presheaf.map (homOfLE h₂).op (V.presheaf.map (homOfLE h₁).op a) =
      V.presheaf.map (homOfLE (h₂.trans h₁)).op a := by
  rw [← CommRingCat.comp_apply, ← Functor.map_comp]
  rfl

variable [Smooth f]

/-- **Deligne's criterion on a chart of a simple normal crossing family** (Hodge II 3.1). Let
`W` be an affine open of a smooth `k`-scheme `V` with sections `tⱼ` generating ideal sheaves
`J j` on `W`, such that `W ∩ U = D(∏ⱼ tⱼ)` and at every prime of `Γ(V, W)` the differentials of
the `tⱼ` in it are independent. For a relative `q`-form `ω` on `W ∩ U`, the forms `(∏ⱼ cⱼ) ω` and
`(∏ⱼ cⱼ) dω` extend over every affine `W' ⊆ W`, for all `cⱼ ∈ (J j)(W')`, if and only if `ω`,
read in `⋀^q Ω[Γ(V, W ∩ U)⁄k]`, has logarithmic poles along the `tⱼ`. -/
theorem forall_exists_extension_iff_mem_logForms (W : V.affineOpens) {ι : Type*} [Fintype ι]
    (J : ι → V.IdealSheafData) (t : ι → Γ(V, W)) (hJ : ∀ j, (J j).ideal W = Ideal.span {t j})
    (U : V.Opens) (hWU : (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U = V.basicOpen (∏ j, t j))
    (hS : letI := MMP.Mori.sectionAlgebra f W
      ∀ 𝔭 : PrimeSpectrum Γ(V, W),
        LinearIndependent 𝔭.asIdeal.ResidueField
          (fun j : {j : ι // t j ∈ 𝔭.asIdeal} ↦
            ((1 : 𝔭.asIdeal.ResidueField) ⊗ₜ[Γ(V, W)] D k Γ(V, W) (t j) :
              𝔭.asIdeal.ResidueField ⊗[Γ(V, W)] Ω[Γ(V, W)⁄k])))
    (q : ℕ) (ω : Γ(f.relativeDifferentialForms (q : ℤ), (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U)) :
    (∀ (W' : V.affineOpens) (hW' : (W' : V.Opens) ≤ W) (c : ι → Γ(V, W')),
        (∀ j, c j ∈ (J j).ideal W') →
        (∃ η : Γ(f.relativeDifferentialForms (q : ℤ), W'),
          (f.relativeDifferentialForms (q : ℤ)).presheaf.map
              (homOfLE (inf_le_left : (W' : V.Opens) ⊓ U ≤ W')).op η =
            V.presheaf.map (homOfLE (inf_le_left : (W' : V.Opens) ⊓ U ≤ W')).op (∏ j, c j) •
              (f.relativeDifferentialForms (q : ℤ)).presheaf.map
                (homOfLE (inf_le_inf_right U hW')).op ω) ∧
        (∃ η : Γ(f.relativeDifferentialForms ((q + 1 : ℕ) : ℤ), W'),
          (f.relativeDifferentialForms ((q + 1 : ℕ) : ℤ)).presheaf.map
              (homOfLE (inf_le_left : (W' : V.Opens) ⊓ U ≤ W')).op η =
            V.presheaf.map (homOfLE (inf_le_left : (W' : V.Opens) ⊓ U ≤ W')).op (∏ j, c j) •
              (f.relativeDifferentialForms ((q + 1 : ℕ) : ℤ)).presheaf.map
                (homOfLE (inf_le_inf_right U hW')).op
                  (((f.deRhamComplex).d q (q + 1)).val.app (op ((W : V.Opens) ⊓ U)) ω))) ↔
      letI := MMP.Mori.sectionAlgebra f W
      letI := MMP.Mori.sectionAlgebra f ((W : V.Opens) ⊓ U)
      letI : Algebra Γ(V, W) Γ(V, (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U) :=
        (V.presheaf.map (homOfLE (inf_le_left : (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U ≤ W)).op).hom.toAlgebra
      ((formsAlgEquiv f q ⟨(W : V.Opens) ⊓ U, isAffineOpen_of_eq_basicOpen _ hWU⟩ ω :
          ⋀[Γ(V, (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U)]^q (Ω[Γ(V, (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U)⁄k])) :
        ExteriorAlgebra Γ(V, (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U) (Ω[Γ(V, (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U)⁄k])) ∈
        logForms k Γ(V, (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U) t q := by
  have hOW : (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U ≤ W := inf_le_left
  let := MMP.Mori.sectionAlgebra f W
  let := MMP.Mori.sectionAlgebra f ((W : V.Opens) ⊓ U)
  let : Algebra Γ(V, W) Γ(V, (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U) :=
    (V.presheaf.map (homOfLE (inf_le_left : (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U ≤ W)).op).hom.toAlgebra
  have := MMP.Flips.ResolutionInputs.isScalarTower_section_res f
    (inf_le_left : (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U ≤ W)
  have : IsLocalization.Away (∏ j, t j) Γ(V, (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U) :=
    isLocalization_away_of_eq_basicOpen _ hWU inf_le_left
  have : Algebra.Smooth k Γ(V, W) := MMP.Flips.ResolutionInputs.smooth_sectionAlgebra f W.2
  refine Iff.trans ?_ (coe_mem_logForms_iff (L := Γ(V, (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U)) hS
    (formsAlgEquiv f q ⟨(W : V.Opens) ⊓ U, isAffineOpen_of_eq_basicOpen _ hWU⟩ ω)).symm
  have e1 := exists_presheaf_map_eq_smul_iff f q (W := W) (isAffineOpen_of_eq_basicOpen _ hWU)
    hOW (∏ j, t j) ω
  have e2 := exists_presheaf_map_eq_smul_iff f (q + 1) (W := W)
    (isAffineOpen_of_eq_basicOpen _ hWU) hOW (∏ j, t j)
    (((f.deRhamComplex).d q (q + 1)).val.app (op ((W : V.Opens) ⊓ U)) ω)
  have hd := formsAlgEquiv_d f q ⟨(W : V.Opens) ⊓ U, isAffineOpen_of_eq_basicOpen _ hWU⟩ ω
  simp only [hd] at e2
  rw [and_congr_left_iff.2 (fun _ ↦ e1.symm), and_congr_right_iff.2 (fun _ ↦ e2.symm)]
  constructor
  · intro H
    obtain ⟨⟨η₁, h₁⟩, ⟨η₂, h₂⟩⟩ :=
      H W le_rfl t fun j ↦ hJ j ▸ Ideal.mem_span_singleton_self _
    exact ⟨⟨η₁, h₁.trans (congrArg (_ • ·) (modules_map_homOfLE_self _ _ _))⟩,
      ⟨η₂, h₂.trans (congrArg (_ • ·) (modules_map_homOfLE_self _ _ _))⟩⟩
  · rintro ⟨⟨η₁, h₁⟩, ⟨η₂, h₂⟩⟩ W' hW' c hc
    have hc' : ∀ j, ∃ a, a * V.presheaf.map (homOfLE hW').op (t j) = c j := by
      intro j
      have := hc j
      rwa [← (J j).map_ideal (U := W') (V := W) hW', hJ, Ideal.map_span, Set.image_singleton,
        Ideal.mem_span_singleton'] at this
    choose a ha using hc'
    have hprod : ∏ j, c j = (∏ j, a j) * V.presheaf.map (homOfLE hW').op (∏ j, t j) := by
      rw [map_prod, ← Finset.prod_mul_distrib]
      exact Finset.prod_congr rfl fun j _ ↦ (ha j).symm
    have hres : ∀ {G : V.Modules} (η : Γ(G, W)) (θ : Γ(G, (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U)),
        G.presheaf.map (homOfLE (inf_le_left : (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U ≤ W)).op η =
          V.presheaf.map (homOfLE (inf_le_left : (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U ≤ W)).op (∏ j, t j) • θ →
        G.presheaf.map (homOfLE (inf_le_left : (W' : V.Opens) ⊓ U ≤ W')).op
            ((∏ j, a j) • G.presheaf.map (homOfLE hW').op η) =
          V.presheaf.map (homOfLE (inf_le_left : (W' : V.Opens) ⊓ U ≤ W')).op (∏ j, c j) •
            G.presheaf.map (homOfLE (inf_le_inf_right U hW')).op θ := by
      intro G η θ hη
      rw [Scheme.Modules.map_smul, modules_map_homOfLE_comp,
        ← modules_map_homOfLE_comp G (inf_le_left : (W : V.Opens) ⊓ U ≤ W)
          (inf_le_inf_right U hW'), hη, Scheme.Modules.map_smul, hprod, map_mul, mul_smul,
        presheaf_map_homOfLE_comp, presheaf_map_homOfLE_comp]
    exact ⟨⟨_, hres η₁ ω h₁⟩, ⟨_, hres η₂ _ h₂⟩⟩

end Scheme

end MMP.DeRham

end
